# Base URL of the DMC backend API (without a trailing slash).
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the client bundle.
#
#   Development (local FastAPI server):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
#
#   Production: LEAVE EMPTY (same-origin). The production Docker image serves
#   the built SPA and the /api/v1, /health and /uploads routes from a single
#   origin, so API_V1 must resolve to "/api/v1" relative to the current host.
#   The committed .env.production already forces the empty value, so a
#   localhost value can never leak into the production bundle.
#
# Never hardcode a host in application code — everything reads from
# src/config/api.js, which falls back to same-origin (empty string) when
# VITE_API_BASE_URL is not set.